  "name": "Battlefield Inspiration (Ex)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 3rd level, as a move action, the medic can grant herself and all allies within 30 feet a number of temporary hit points equal to the medic's level + her Wisdom modifier that lasts until the end of the encounter. All creatures to be affected must be able to see, hear, and understand the medic to gain the bonuses. This ability can be used once per encounter at 3rd level and she gains one additional use per encounter every three medic levels thereafter (2 at 6th, 3 at 9th, 4 at 12th, 5 at 15th, 6 at 18th).</p>",
